#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:4
msgid "Security Endpoints"
msgstr "Endpoints de Segurança"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Security Server) > "
"Firewall > Rules``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Security Server) > Firewall > Rules``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:11
msgid ""
"Security endpoints represent the source and destination objects in "
"firewall rules and security policies within a network security "
"integration. Endpoints can include IP addresses, IP ranges, network "
"segments, security groups, or service profiles that define what traffic "
"is allowed or denied."
msgstr "Endpoints de segurança representam os objetos de origem e destino em regras de firewall e políticas de segurança dentro de uma integração de segurança de rede. Endpoints podem incluir endereços IP, intervalos de IP, segmentos de rede, security groups ou perfis de serviço que definem qual tráfego é permitido ou negado."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:13
msgid ""
"In |morpheus|, security endpoints are managed as part of the firewall "
"configuration within a security server integration. They provide the "
"building blocks for defining security policies and access control."
msgstr "No |morpheus|, endpoints de segurança são gerenciados como parte da configuração de firewall dentro de uma integração de security server. Eles fornecem os blocos de construção para definir políticas de segurança e controle de acesso."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:16
msgid "Managing Endpoints in Firewall Rules"
msgstr "Gerenciando Endpoints em Regras de Firewall"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:18
msgid ""
"When creating or editing firewall rules within a security server "
"integration, source and destination endpoints are configured as rule "
"parameters:"
msgstr "Ao criar ou editar regras de firewall dentro de uma integração de security server, endpoints de origem e destino são configurados como parâmetros da regra:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:20
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:21
msgid "Select the desired security server integration"
msgstr "Selecione a integração de security server desejada"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:22
msgid "Click the **Firewall** tab"
msgstr "Clique na aba **Firewall**"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:23
msgid "Create or edit a firewall rule"
msgstr "Crie ou edite uma regra de firewall"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:24
msgid "Configure endpoints in the source and destination fields:"
msgstr "Configure endpoints nos campos de origem e destino:"

