#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_endpoints.rst:59
msgid ""
"Access to security endpoint management requires the ``Infrastructure: "
"Network Firewalls`` permission (``infrastructure-network-firewalls``) "
"with ``read``, ``managerules``, or ``full`` access."
msgstr "O acesso ao gerenciamento de endpoints de segurança requer a permissão ``Infrastructure: Network Firewalls`` (``infrastructure-network-firewalls``) com acesso ``read``, ``managerules`` ou ``full``."

